    {
      "id": "chromatin_loci",
      "title": "H3K27me3 profiles at Tigit and Areg",
      "caption": "Figure 5. Two illustrative loci from the five-candidate extension. Exact deposited 100-bp profiles, with the same vertical scale across states within each gene. Tigit and Areg were selected after viewing results to illustrate different chromatin/RNA relationships; all five candidates appear in Figure 6. Shading marks the annotated 5-prime boundary +/-5 kb, not a measured regulatory element. Tracks were already yeast-spike scaled and smoothed in the source; no further smoothing or background subtraction was applied. Each line is an aggregate deposited track. WT IgG supplies background context; no gain-specific IgG is available. A missing 100-bp IgG bin in the Areg flank remains missing and lies outside both summary windows.",
