      "id": "chromatin_rna_context",
      "title": "Five candidates under both WT assignments",
      "caption": "Figure 6. All fixed candidates, both WT assignments. (A) Prior gain-minus-WT RNA estimates in rlog units. (B-C) Log2 ratios of length-weighted aggregate-track means over the annotated gene body and 5-prime boundary +/-5 kb. Filled circles follow GEO; open diamonds swap the two WT state assignments, with gain and IgG unchanged. Connecting segments represent label sensitivity, not uncertainty intervals. RNA and chromatin are joined by gene and experimental context, without a verified mouse/aliquot match. No population significance test is implied.",
